==English==

===Alternative forms===
* [[cry over spilled milk]]

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en-uk-dont cry over spilt milk.ogg|Audio (UK)|lang=en}}

===Verb===
{{en-verb|head=[[cry]] [[over]] [[spilt]] [[milk]]|cries over spilt milk|crying over spilt milk|cried over spilt milk}}

# To [[worry]] about [[unfortunate]] [[event]]s which have [[already]] [[happen]]ed and which cannot be [[change]]d.

==== Usage notes ====
* Usually found as a negative imperative: {{m|en||don't cry over spilt milk}} or {{m|en||there's no use crying over spilt milk}}.

